# Quahog game — .gitignore
# DRAFT for the new PRIVATE repo. See SETUP.md before copying this in.
# Rule: the game's music NEVER enters any repo (Nic's standing instruction).
# The music lives only on the box at /home/ubuntu/products/quahog/music/
# and is deployed around, never through, version control.

# --- Build output ---
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Dependencies ---
node_modules/
.pnp/
.pnp.*

# --- MUSIC — airtight exclusion (do not weaken) ---
# Any directory named "music" at any depth, plus any audio file anywhere.
# If the game ever legitimately needs an audio file, do NOT relax these lines:
# add the exact path to .audio-allowlist and `git add -f` that one file,
# and note why in SETUP.md. scripts/check-no-music.sh enforces this in CI.
music/
**/music/
*.mp3
*.wav
*.flac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.m4a
*.aac
*.wma
*.aiff
*.aif

# --- Local env / secrets (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.token
credentials*
*secret*

# --- Test / coverage / logs ---
coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Misc ---
.cache/
*.tmp
